    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_288.variants.exists_k_gt_2 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∃ k > 2, Set.Finite { I : Fin k → ℕ+ × ℕ+ |\n      ∀ j, (I j).1 ≤ (I j).2 ∧\n        ∃ n : ℕ+, (∑ j : Fin k, ∑ nⱼ ∈ Set.Icc (I j).1 (I j).2, (nⱼ⁻¹ : ℚ)) = n }",
